---
title: "ensureGenerationRoleExists (stem-system: Generation Role Creation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: select generation_roles where generation
    q_check --> q_exists: role exists
    q_check --> q_create: role not found
    q_exists --> [*]: no-op (return)
    q_create --> q_api_call: POST /api/generation to Discord bot API
    q_api_call --> q_success: role created (generation + discord_role_id)
    q_api_call --> q_error: API error
    q_success --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return
    q_error --> [*]: log error, swallow (idempotent ensure)

    note right of q_create
        INV-001: ensure is idempotent (errors are swallowed)
        INV-002: Discord bot API creates the Discord role and saves mapping to DB
    end note
